Z||000013||Hock||05-24-99||12:19 PM||||yes you can get serius horsepower out of that four.  their are several companies that have performance parts for fiero four cyl.  here is the list<br>Speed Pro: Forged Pistons, Oversized Valves,<br>           Cam Shafts<br>Competition Cams: Camshafts, Pushrods<br>Crane Cams: Rocker Arms, Camshafts?<br>Hooker: Headers (of course)<br>Holley: TBI, Intake Manifolds, 4Bbl carb<br>Clifford: Intake, Header, Misc.<p>These are just what I have found for mine, but I'm sure if youlook hard enough you'll find more 
